codex
The focused test exposed a test-assumption issue, not a route failure: PostgreSQL’s configured collation orders the existing mixed-case `"Foo"` differently from Python’s default string sort. I’m tightening the title assertion to compare two known lowercase sentinel titles by their response positions, while retaining the full-list `created_at` ordering assertion.
